      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "These issues could indicate a few possibilities: conflicting routines, a malfunctioning device, or potential unauthorized access. First, ensure that the dimming and thermostat changes are not linked to any routines set in your app. Next, check the security of your Wi-Fi network by changing the password, ensuring it's secure. You can use a password manager to help remember the new secure credentials. Additionally, consider setting up separate Wi-Fi networks for your smart devices and personal use, and see if that resolves the issue. If these steps don't help, it might be a good idea to contact manufacturers or security experts for further guidance.",
